# W31g, host a (k10): hosts Dry Land; once b and c went on to stag0202 a, alone in stag0201, goes into dng204b1 and out
# again three times (depart: the exits' own targets, dng204b1 point 0 and back to stag0201 point 1).
campaign until stage=stagml11,control
idle until epoch>=@80
explore mate00 until onme:mate00
gate mate00 1 until stage=stag0201,control
log a hosts Dry Land
idle until epoch>=@500
idle until present=1 fail epoch>=@760
log a alone in stag0201
depart dng204b1 0 until stage=dng204b1,control
depart stag0201 1 until stage=stag0201,control
depart dng204b1 0 until stage=dng204b1,control
depart stag0201 1 until stage=stag0201,control
depart dng204b1 0 until stage=dng204b1,control
log a in dng204b1 the third time
idle until frames>=1200
